          "high": "One large one. The day of the merge, page four: both versions were wrong. I kept neither yours nor hers; I wrote a sentence of my own. You read it and did not notice. That sentence is lying in the boss's unread now. In thirteen months it is the only time I have spoken for you. I did not put it badly.",
